& |\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nNotice that swapping the blocks on the main diagonal of $B$ will result in switching the corresponding columns in $P.$\n\n- From our block diagonal matrix \n\n$$\nB=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 4 & 0 \\\\ -4 & 3 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwe deduce the complex eigenvalues are ${\\lambda }_{1,2}=3\\pm 4\\text{i}$ and the real eigenvalue is ${\\lambda }_{3}=2.$\n\n- From our matrix \n\n$$\nP=[\\begin{aligned}5 & 4 & -3 \\\\ -2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 1 & 2\\end{aligned}],\n$$\n\nwe deduce that the complex and real eigenvectors are\n\n$$\n{v}_{1,2}=[\\begin{aligned}5\\pm 4\\text{i} \\\\ -2\\pm 3\\text{i} \\\\ \\pm \\text{i}\\end{aligned}],\\,{v}_{3}=[\\begin{aligned}-3 \\\\ -1 \\\\ 2\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186400736 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "abbdd778-7ace-5539-9d6f-cdf01804b237" :knowledge-point/title "Constructing a Stochastic Matrix Given Some Data"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "88e5b5b4-2dbb-5da4-824a-44c309ccb154" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Rain** | **Dry** |\n| To: | **Rain** | $0.62$ | $0.45$ |\n| **Dry** | $0.38$ | $0.55$ |  |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400738} {:answer/id #uuid "574fb5f8-e987-5592-8f6a-6ba872092af4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Rain** | **Dry** |\n| To: | **Rain** | $0.38$ | $0.45$ |\n| **Dry** | $0.62$ | $0.55$ |  |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400739} {:answer/id #uuid "b19ea57e-8f9d-5793-af8d-9ddd67581e56" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "|  |  | From: |  |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|  |  | **Rain** | **Dry** |\n| To: | **Rain** | $0.45$ | $0.38$ |\n| **Dry** | $0.55$ | $0.62$ |  |" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186400740} {:answer/id #uuid "ccb01000-d1a6-589d-b667-eb5990cf355b" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "|  