| To: | **Rain** | $0.62$ | $0.45$ |\n| **Dry** | $0.38$ | $0.55$ |  |\n\nNote that we can write a corresponding stochastic matrix as follows:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}0.62 & 0.45 \\\\ 0.38 & 0.55\\end{aligned}].\n$$"}]}
